type: software
title: "ziviSynthi AKS: An Open-Source Pin-Matrix Synthesizer Firmware Inspired by the EMS Synthi AKS"
authors:
  - family-names: Soares Valentim
    given-names: Victor Hugo
    affiliation: Universidade Federal do Recôncavo da Bahia
