identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.24617383
    description: Concept DOI for the series of archived versions
repository-code: https://github.com/vicvalentim/ziviSynthi-AKS
url: https://vicvalentim.github.io/ziviSynthi-AKS/
license: GPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  ziviSynthi AKS is an independent research instrument for digital lutherie
  and embedded music computing. Inspired by the EMS Synthi AKS, it pairs a
  16 × 16 signal and modulation matrix with a C synthesis engine for the
  M-VAVE SMK-37 Pro and a bilingual Web Studio for browser synthesis, patch
  editing and communication over USB MIDI.
keywords:
  - digital lutherie
  - computer music
  - pin-matrix synthesis
  - digital signal processing
  - embedded audio
  - Web MIDI
